{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, go towards it, grab and process if needed, if not, randomly move or avoid obstacles. list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToFindObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = AskForHelp    /> <Action ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = IsObjectInRange    /> <Action ID = isObjectHeavy    /> <Action ID = ProcessObject    /> <Action ID = RandomMove    /> <Action ID = IsObstacleDetected    /> <Action ID = AvoidObstacle    />\"",
