    "code": "\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\tIF IsObjectVisible? THEN\n\t\t\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\t\tDO MoveToFindObject\n\t\t\t\t\tIF IsObjectInRange? THEN\n\t\t\t\t\tDO GrabObject\n\t\t\tELSE\n\t\t\t\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\t\t\t\tIF isObjectHeavy? THEN\n\t\t\t\t\t\tDO AskForHelp\n\t\t\t\tEND\n\t\t\tEND\n\tEND\n"
